experiment.prespecified:
Fixed 2026-11-17, before any result was read (borg-zoo#216). Pilot only. Gate: no config_error; one binary;
each arm's two flags written in its borg.txt and reported by params-core.json on the death replays; every
cell ends in death, turn_cap or borg_stopped; frozen-turn stalls, purchase bursts and key outliers listed;
in ctl, none of #503's notes in the death replays. Descriptive, per arm and per class: deaths and causes,
final level, deepest level, town visits; '# Scary guy on level.' and '# Fleeing (breeder level)' notes;
breeder kills; descents and down-then-up bounces (from replays where the records do not hold them).
Paired against ctl on the same start: rescued, newly killed, identical play. 18 starts per arm cannot show
which flags are better.
